 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 2.136,
   "text": "Maya gives last night's show"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.176,
   "end": 3.812,
   "text": "four and a half stars."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.852,
   "end": 4.803,
   "text": "One tap."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.843,
   "end": 7.736,
   "text": "To keep that tap true, Onda needs a contract,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.776,
   "end": 11.005,
   "text": "a lock, and a database with three layers."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.251,
   "end": 13.345,
   "text": "The tap becomes a PUT request."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.385,
   "end": 15.783,
   "text": "It names a state, not an action."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.823,
   "end": 18.754,
   "text": "Send it once: 201, created."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.794,
   "end": 22.107,
   "text": "Send it again: 200. Still one row."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.147,
   "end": 24.469,
   "text": "And every failure has one meaning."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.509,
   "end": 27.059,
   "text": "400: your request is wrong."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.099,
   "end": 29.269,
   "text": "409: your request is right,"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.309,
   "end": 31.509,
   "text": "but the state is not ready."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.709,
   "end": 34.869,
   "text": "Inside, the code reads, then writes."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.909,
   "end": 36.011,
   "text": "At READ COMMITTED,"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.051,
   "end": 38.488,
   "text": "two requests can both read \"no entry\","
  },
  {
   "start": 38.528,
   "end": 40.164,
   "text": "and both try to insert."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.204,
   "end": 43.148,
   "text": "So the service locks one row first, the user's,"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.188,
   "end": 45.002,
   "text": "and the second request waits."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.042,
   "end": 46.83,
   "text": "If any code forgets the lock,"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.87,
   "end": 50.061,
   "text": "a unique key refuses the second row."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.261,
   "end": 53.421,
   "text": "But where did event 847 come from?"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.461,
   "end": 55.326,
   "text": "Every night, Onda reads listings"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.366,
   "end": 57.688,
   "text": "from a site it does not control."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.728,
   "end": 60.05,
   "text": "So the database has three layers."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.09,
   "end": 62.107,
   "text": "Evidence: every response,"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.147,
   "end": 64.316,
   "text": "stored before anything reads it."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.356,
   "end": 67.211,
   "text": "Catalog: only what passes validation."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.251,
   "end": 69.954,
   "text": "One listing, one transaction."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.994,
   "end": 71.859,
   "text": "Social: what people did."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.899,
   "end": 73.129,
   "text": "Keys point one way,"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.169,
   "end": 75.745,
   "text": "and the source's ID stops at a map."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.785,
   "end": 77.116,
   "text": "If a listing vanishes,"
  },
  {
   "start": 77.156,
   "end": 80.011,
   "text": "only a complete snapshot counts as a miss."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.051,
   "end": 81.992,
   "text": "Three misses hide the event."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.032,
   "end": 84.004,
   "text": "Nothing deletes it."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.204,
   "end": 86.069,
   "text": "Now Leo opens Home."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.109,
   "end": 87.821,
   "text": "There is no feed table."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.861,
   "end": 90.03,
   "text": "One query, five branches."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.07,
   "end": 92.545,
   "text": "Each branch filters privacy first."
  },
  {
   "start": 92.585,
   "end": 95.897,
   "text": "Then one sort, by time, type, and key:"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.937,
   "end": 97.345,
   "text": "a total order."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.385,
   "end": 99.25,
   "text": "The cursor is the last key,"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.29,
   "end": 101.611,
   "text": "so new rows never shift his page."
  },
  {
   "start": 101.651,
   "end": 104.278,
   "text": "Maya's rating is there on his next request."
  },
  {
   "start": 104.318,
   "end": 106.594,
   "text": "No copy to go stale."
  },
  {
   "start": 106.794,
   "end": 111.402,
   "text": "One tap. One row. Three layers. No copies."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.442,
   "end": 113.49,
   "text": "This is Onda."
  }
 ]
}
